source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A lone backslash before the pair is no run of its own and blocks nothing after it, so the pair breaks; jiro keeps the single backslash and reads the hard break.
-- input.jira --
a\b\\c
-- rendered.html --
<p>a\b<br class="atl-forced-newline" />c</p>
-- want.md --
a\\b\
c
-- warnings.json --
[]
